{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13528","headline":"观于舍人壁画山水 · 王季友","name":"观于舍人壁画山水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野人宿在人家少，朝见此山谓山晓。\n半壁仍栖岭上云，开帘欲放湖中鸟。\n独坐长松是阿谁，再三招手起来迟。\n于公大笑向予说，小弟丹青能尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}